稍长。取尾部即可：
```
  return release as UsablePackageRelease;
}
```
但要包含足够上下文且唯一。文件中 "return release as UsablePackageRelease;" 只出现一次。用它加下一行。

suggestion:
```
  const { manifest } = release;
  if (!manifest) throw packageError("PACKAGE_UNSUPPORTED");
  return { ...release, manifest } satisfies UsablePackageRelease;
```
注意：satisfies 需要类型上下文。`{ ...release, manifest }` 中 release 是 PackageReleaseFacts，manifest 已 narrow 为 PackageManifestV1。返回类型位置是 UsablePackageRelease = PackageReleaseFacts & { readonly manifest: PackageManifestV1 }。spread 结果应满足。用 satisfies 让编译器验证，代替 as。好。

